lace includes the Texas Native Trail, Water Saver Garden, Conservatory, and Rose Garden.","source_url":"https://www.sa.gov/Directory/Departments/Parks/Parks-Facilities/Buildings-Centers/San-Antonio-Botanical-Garden","source_title":"San Antonio Botanical Garden | City of San Antonio","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The garden directs visitors to its official site for current admission information; its City listing gives hours as 8 a.m.–6 p.m.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mcnay-art-museum","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"McNay Art Museum","title":"McNay Art Museum: sculpture grounds and galleries","subtitle":"North New Braunfels Avenue corridor","notes":"Bring your Trinity ID for general admission, then pair gallery time with a walk through the museum’s sculpture grounds during their posted daily hours.","short_summary":"A 25-acre art-museum campus with outdoor sculpture grounds.","evidence_claim":"McNay states that Trinity University students, faculty, and staff receive free general admission, and that its sculpture grounds are open daily.","source_url":"https://www.mcnayart.org/visit/","source_title":"Visit | McNay Art Museum","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Trinity ID qualifies for free general admission; special exhibitions may have separate access charges.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"san-antonio-museum-of-art","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"San Antonio Museum of Art","title":"San Antonio Museum of Art: global art collections","subtitle":"West Jones Avenue corridor","notes":"Bring a Trinity ID for general admission and use the museum’s visitor information to plan a gallery visit at its Museum Reach location.","short_summary":"An art museum presenting works from a broad range of cultures and eras.","evidence_claim":"San Antonio Museum of Art says Trinity University students, faculty, and staff receive free general admission with institutional identification and lists its address as 200 West Jones Avenue.","source_url":"https://www.samuseum.org/visita/","source_title":"Visita | San Antonio Museum of Art","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free general admission requires Trinity institutional ID; review the museum’s visit page for current public hours.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
